WEBVTT

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:15.250
Ma'am! I want two baskets of soba!

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:16.140
And take your time!

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:17.800
Hurry! Hurry! It's about to start!

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:21.370
Only two for so many of you?

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:21.890
Yeah.

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:23.480
Come on, hurry! The TV! The TV!

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:24.610
All right, I'm coming!

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:26.270
Here you go!

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:29.980
This truly is an explosion of young power!

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:34.260
The representatives of Kantou and Kansai, who have fought through the tough preliminaries...

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:38.230
are now facing each other in the finals of this year's rookie tournament!

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:39.910
I've been waiting for this!

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.870
I can't just have you kids changing the channel like this...

00:01:43.690 --> 00:01:47.250
Ma'am, if you live here,

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:49.920
you must've heard of Joe, haven't you?

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:52.880
What? Joe's gonna be on TV?

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:56.720
No, no. Joe's rival Rikiishi will.

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:01.600
To know Joe, you gotta know Rikiishi. That's the deal.

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:05.160
Now it's time for the fighters to enter the ring.

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:05.160
Hey.

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:08.800
Have any of you seen Joe around?

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:10.610
What about Bro Joe?

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:13.010
He borrowed some money from Noriko at the grocery

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:14.780
and then disappeared somewhere!

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:16.780
R-Really?

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:22.790
I hope he hasn't gone desperate 'cause he can't become a pro...

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:28.870
"There is no future for a man whose dreams are crushed..."

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:29.790
Hey!

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:33.300
How could you say that? Bro Joe's not like that!

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:35.640
Ow, ow, ow. I'm sorry.

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:38.360
Joe... Where have you gone?

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:39.710
Joe... Where have you gone?

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:49.860
So these are the rookies who have fought through to this point...

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:52.870
They've got some nice pictures, that's for sure.

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:58.720
Whatever the case,

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:03.810
this is the best chance I have to rebuild my bridge to the world of boxing.

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:36.530
<i>Thank you for coming to today's matches.</i>

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:39.160
<i>I have an announcement to make.</i>

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:45.040
<i>The first match of the National Rookie Tournament Finals is about to begin!</i>

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:48.020
<i>The first match will be for the Flyweight Championship.</i>

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:51.610
<i>"Sleepy" Sumino, representing East Japan,</i>

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:55.070
<i>against Golgo Kanayama, representing West Japan.</i>

00:03:55.070 --> 00:03:58.670
<i>"Sleepy" Sumino, representing East Japan,</i>

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:02.170
<i>against Golgo Kanayama, representing West Japan.</i>

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.320
It's starting... Gotta hurry...

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:19.320
Hey, Bro!

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:22.280
Th-The match has already started! What are you doing just sitting there?

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:26.790
It's just the rookie tournament. It's not that big a deal.

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:27.780
Huh?

00:04:30.690 --> 00:04:33.000
You sure are prepared, Mister!

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:37.000
I like to watch boxing even more than I like eating!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.010
Oh, dammit! The match!

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:47.660
Now, then...

00:04:57.740 --> 00:04:59.450
Fighters' waiting room.

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:02.320
No unauthorized entry...

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:14.550
Come on! Your match is about to start!

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:15.460
Hey, second!

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.230
Where'd my second go?

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:19.220
Dammit, what am I gonna do with him?

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:23.320
What? You still have to take a piss?

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:27.080
Uh... I only could get out a few drops last time, I was there to calm my nerves.

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:29.170
Well, I guess you can't help being nervous.

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:30.970
Fine! Go quickly!

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.390
Oh, gotta go, gotta go...

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:41.820
Y-You asshole!

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:45.350
You made me trip on purpose, didn't you?

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:48.510
What? You tripped over my leg?

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:50.750
Guess I'd better watch my leg more closely...

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:53.450
What? You didn't notice, you say?

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:55.280
What's the matter, Kanagushi?

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:57.460
What are you dawdling for?

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:02.480
You see, this guy just fell over, and now he's blaming me for it.

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:03.970
He said he'd beat me up.

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:05.260
Wh-What!?

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:06.340
Y-You yellow...

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:07.430
Hold it!

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:09.940
Don't you go causing trouble before the match.

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:11.430
Just hurry up and use the toilet!

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:13.430
Okay.

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:18.230
If he's the type to fall over after being tripped...

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:19.690
he must be a lousy fighter.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:21.190
What?

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:23.590
It's one thing if he's facing a coward,

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:25.190
but in normal circumstances, he'd lose.

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:28.630
What the hell are you talking about? How impolite!

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:30.950
Besides, this place is off-limits to people who aren't authorized!

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:33.700
Well, I'm authorized, in a way.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:34.950
Well, I'm authorized, in a way.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:36.020
Now move it.

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.460
Wolf Kanagushi, eh?

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:42.060
That's a pretty cocky name.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:51.370
Now, remember, don't panic! Stay calm, stay calm!

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:52.450
Y-Yeah.

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:56.620
Pathetic.

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:59.210
He looks totally different from the picture.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:01.610
Well then, we'll be watching you from the ringside.

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:03.340
Do your best, Rikiishi-kun.

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:05.570
Oh?

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:08.950
Well if it isn't Yabuki-kun!

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:15.450
We finally meet somewhere decent, young lady.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.950
What have you come here for?

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:20.890
Oh, I don't really have any business here.

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:22.840
I just came here to hang out.

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:24.460
Hey, Yabuki.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:29.280
Have you come to celebrate my road to glory?

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.170
Glory?

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:33.290
Don't give me that shit.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:35.350
This is just the rookie tournament.

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.810
At best, it's seeing who's the best of the chicks.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:38.930
Well, do your best.

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:44.900
What has he come here for?

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.910
Joe's eyes looked very strange...

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:49.950
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:06.980
Let's see... "H-36"...

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:08.320
Where is that?

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:10.170
Hmm...

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:12.970
What the hell? All the way in the back?

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:17.120
Not like it makes too much of a difference, but this way I can't see the boxers' faces.

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:18.380
Hey, Bro!

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:22.000
Well if it isn't the old man I met earlier!

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:24.940
Don't you think that's a little bit of a poor seat for such a boxing fan like you?

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:26.930
You've gotta be kidding!

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:29.310
When you watch a play, the best seats are on the balcony! And same here!

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:33.060
Go, Wolf Kanagushi!

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:35.310
Wolf Kanagushi?

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:42.800
Hit him! Hit him, Wolf!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:45.900
Hook! Hook!

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:48.960
Idiot! Straight right! Straight right!

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:53.850
As predicted in the "Golden Egg" advance reviews,

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:55.430
Wolf Kanagushi is throwing excellent punches!

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:59.470
He's one-sidedly beating Aizawa, the Kansai representative!

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:02.200
Wolf has driven Aizawa to the ropes,

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:04.230
and he's rushing him! What a rush!

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:11.780
And he throws a hook! Aizawa's trying to move left, but Wolf won't let him escape!

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:14.450
Wolf's right connected cleanly!

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.260
Old man, is Wolf Kanagushi really that strong?

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:19.950
Old man, is Wolf Kanagushi really that strong?

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:22.540
Oh, he's more than just strong!

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:26.030
The highlights of this year's rookie tournament were the bantamweight Kanagushi...

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:29.420
and the featherweight Rikiishi! That's how good he is!

00:09:31.390 --> 00:09:34.310
So I guess I'd better take down that highlight first.

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:35.430
This is gonna be fun.

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:38.760
Aizawa's knocked back into the ropes!

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:40.850
He can't move! His legs are giving way!

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:48.080
Coach Otaka of Asia Gym is looking on from the ringside, satisfied, at Wolf's sharp fight!

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:03.640
And there's his powerful stomach blow!

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:10.410
And the winner of the rookie tournament for the bantamweight class, is Wolf Kanagushi, the "young wolf"!

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:12.570
Wolf Kanagushi!

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:16.380
Way to go, Asia Gym!

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:20.200
Let's see... He knocked him out in two minutes and 33 seconds...

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:23.390
Coach Otaka of the Asia Gym keeps putting out amazing rookies, doesn't he?

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.080
Coach Otaka of the Asia Gym...

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:30.830
He was the one who forced old man Danpei out of the boxing association.

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:33.550
This is getting more and more interesting!

00:10:36.350 --> 00:10:39.460
Finally, next up is the featherweight final!

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:44.410
It's Rikiishi!

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:46.160
We've been waiting for you, Rikiishi!

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:48.870
Keep setting the KO record!

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:50.190
You can do it!

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:54.500
He's so cool!

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:55.420
Ouch!

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:58.430
Come on, Kinoko! Do you want me to leave a scar?

00:10:58.430 --> 00:10:59.930
No... I'm sorry...

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.960
Rikiishi Toru is entering the ring!

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:06.140
And what popularity! You wouldn't think this is the rookie tournament!

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:08.690
The crowd is acting as if this is a world title match!

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:12.650
Rikiishi-kun.

00:11:13.140 --> 00:11:14.780
Do your best, Rikiishi-kun.

00:11:14.780 --> 00:11:16.650
Rikiishi-kun, give it your all!

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:20.990
The "V" sign for "Victory"...

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:23.160
Thank you, Miss.

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:32.900
Everything he does is so extravagant! You'd never imagine he's just a rookie!

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:39.880
How strange that no matter how much Rikiishi shows off, no one complains.

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:45.510
I can't watch Rikiishi fight a match all the way from the nosebleeds.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:48.940
H-Hey, Bro!

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:50.970
Don't go up there or the officials will be mad at you!

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:52.440
Hey! Bro!

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:33.000
B-Bro Joe's on TV!

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:35.060
You're right!

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:36.680
He looks so cool!

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:39.830
Ma'am! Hurry, you gotta see this!

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:41.070
What, where?

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:42.610
He's not there!

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:44.280
He was there, I swear!

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:45.150
Right, guys?

00:12:45.150 --> 00:12:47.560
Man, Bro Joe's so lucky to be on TV!

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:54.590
Yabuki-kun!

00:12:54.590 --> 00:13:01.050
<i>In the blue corner, the Featherweight Kansai Representative, from Okejima Boxing Club...</i>

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:03.550
<i>Hachisuka Saburo!</i>

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:13.060
<i>And in the red corner, the Featherweight Kantou Representative, from Shiraki Gym...</i>

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:15.560
<i>Rikiishi Toru!</i>

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:51.560
Hey, Rikiishi! Pay attention!

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.020
Fight!

00:13:54.670 --> 00:13:55.850
Something's wrong with Rikiishi!

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:58.980
It's like he didn't even hear the bell!

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:01.530
The sneaky Hachisuka has taken this chance to attack!

00:14:01.530 --> 00:14:02.970
What's the matter, Rikiishi!?

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:04.310
What the hell!?

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:05.530
This isn't like you at all!

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:08.070
What's wrong?

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:09.640
Rikiishi! What are you doing?

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:11.580
Don't look away in the middle of a fight!

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:12.790
Now!

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.160
And it connected!

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:20.350
It looks like that body shot took its toll!

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:23.590
Rikiishi is completely ignoring his opponent's cover!

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:28.930
He's throwing a storm of hammer punches that's completely breaking through his opponent's defense!

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:46.840
That was cool! You did it, Rikiishi!

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:47.820
Way to go, Rikiishi!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:50.570
You're the rookie champion!

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:53.860
It's only been 54 seconds since the first bell rang!

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:57.090
Rikiishi won with an overwhelming KO!

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:59.580
That was an amazing win as ever.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:01.090
Rikiishi!

00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:03.430
If it weren't this way I wouldn't have anyone to motivate me.

00:15:03.430 --> 00:15:05.790
Especially in this job I'm about to start.

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:10.450
What's he trying to do?

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:22.270
Well, it looks like you're really popular with the media, eh?

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:25.030
Oh, Coach Otaka of the Asia Gym.

00:15:25.030 --> 00:15:28.830
I heard your Rikiishi-kun won by KO in 54 seconds!

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:30.500
Many congratulations!

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:32.030
Thank you so much. And also to you.

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:36.580
It looks like it was worth it to use your resources to build a good gym!

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:42.540
A fighter like Rikiishi-kun could very well take off as a world-class boxer soon!

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.060
Oh, please cut the flattery.

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:49.050
Your fighter, Wolf Kanagushi, is quite the fighter as well.

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:52.950
Isn't Wolf great? His name's pretty great, too!

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:57.060
He's the golden egg I've been raising all this time!

00:15:57.770 --> 00:15:58.540
In three... no, two years...

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:00.450
In three... no, two years...

00:16:00.450 --> 00:16:02.860
he'll be the world bantamweight champion!

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:09.990
May I get a shot of the future champion Kanagushi together with Rikiishi?

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:14.450
That'll be good! This'll be a big scoop!

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:18.450
Hey! Wolf's being cornered by some strange fan!

00:16:19.050 --> 00:16:20.750
Strange fan?

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:24.250
Yeah! He keeps pestering him to get his autograph!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:28.270
Well, that's impressive! He's just the rookie champion, and people already want his autograph...

00:16:28.270 --> 00:16:30.260
He's already getting famous!

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:34.250
Just tell him to give him his signature! He's a man destined for greatness, after all!

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:37.150
All right, I'll go.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:41.270
A strange fan... Could it be...?

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:46.810
What seems to be the problem, Wolf?

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:50.570
Is that the boy who wants your autograph?

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:52.300
Yes.

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:58.110
Otaka-san, looks like your Wolf is pretty tightfisted!

00:16:58.110 --> 00:17:00.620
Can't he give out an autograph or two?

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:06.580
I knew it. It's Yabuki.

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:09.530
Come on, Wolf. Just write something.

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:12.590
The reporters want a picture of you and Rikiishi.

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:17.140
Coach, this was the guy who made Wolf trip before the fight.

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:17.850
What?

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:23.380
Nevermind.

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:25.470
He'll leave if you give him your autograph!

00:17:25.470 --> 00:17:26.730
Just sign already!

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:30.860
Oh, you'll give me your autograph?

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:31.870
That makes me happy!

00:17:31.180 --> 00:17:32.480
<i>Give me your autograph book.</i>

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:33.860
Here you go!

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:42.910
Here.

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.340
What the hell is this!?

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:55.730
Now, that should be enough, young man.

00:17:55.730 --> 00:17:59.300
Wolf's a little busy right now, so would you mind leaving?

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:03.310
But man, this is sloppy handwriting!

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:06.400
Is this even writing?

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:08.260
They look more like drawings of worms!

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:09.980
Wow, this is terrible! Totally terrible!

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:11.910
G-Goddamn it...

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:12.670
Wait, Wolf!

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:13.480
But...

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:16.450
You're a funny guy, young man.

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:19.040
A boxer doesn't have to have good handwriting, you know!

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:21.400
It's all about punching, after all!

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:24.410
Well then, what about his punches?

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:33.840
I watched a bit of his match just now.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.460
It was nothing special.

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:39.440
Call him the golden egg of the Asia Gym or whatever...

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:42.790
but I'd say I was watching a pickpocket's show.

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:44.530
P-Pickpocket!?

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:45.740
That's right.

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:49.980
They weren't fair punches that broke the opponent's guard from the front, like Rikiishi's.

00:18:50.470 --> 00:18:53.100
They were more like a pickpocket cutting purse strings.

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:55.440
They were dirty punches that lacked dignity!

00:18:56.310 --> 00:18:57.580
I see now...

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:59.450
Joe is picking a fight with Wolf!

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:03.480
Throw this brat out of here!

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:04.080
Wait!

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:07.080
Let me handle this kid! {Best Scene Bleed ever!!!}

00:19:11.490 --> 00:19:13.090
I've been waiting for this moment!

00:20:06.190 --> 00:20:08.370
Th-The Cross Counter!

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:14.190
The secret punch that he used to draw our match in the prison's boxing tournament!

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:19.440
Wolf...

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:35.170
Wolf... Wolf...

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:39.590
No, no, no! Stop taking photos!

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:40.930
Stop taking photos!

00:20:51.840 --> 00:20:53.350
No! Wolf!

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:00.990
Joe...

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:02.320
Yabuki-kun...

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:09.330
Wolf! Hang in there, Wolf!

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:15.830
H-He's no amateur! He scored a draw with Wolf with just one punch!

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:20.340
The Cross Counter is an advanced technique, too!

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:23.340
Rikiishi appears to know this young man.

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:24.600
Yabuki Joe.

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:27.350
He's a bantamweight fighter from the Tange Boxing Club.

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:29.350
Tange!?

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:32.290
Tange Boxing Club? Have you heard of that gym before?

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:33.350
I've never heard of it.

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:35.030
It's only natural that you don't know of it.

00:21:35.030 --> 00:21:39.320
Tange Danpei, coach of the Tange Gym, was denied his license

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:44.550
due to the unanimous refusal of the Japanese Boxing Association coaches, beginning with Otaka over there.

00:21:44.550 --> 00:21:47.570
So even though Yabuki Joe here has amazing talent,

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:49.650
he can't even take the professional test.

00:21:49.650 --> 00:21:51.830
He literally is a nameless fighter.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:55.830
Shiraki-sensei! It's not like I was the only one that denied him his license!

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:58.740
Hey, isn't this Yabuki a Bantamweight?

00:21:58.740 --> 00:22:00.380
And Wolf Kanagushi is a Bantamweight, too.

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:03.650
But he can't get a professional license because Otaka denied it.

00:22:03.650 --> 00:22:04.840
He really got cheated, didn't he?

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:05.840
Hey!

00:22:06.440 --> 00:22:09.040
You're making it look like I refused Tange Danpei his license

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:12.350
because I was afraid of this Yabuki fellow!

00:22:13.070 --> 00:22:16.480
You're a coach who has trained two world champions!

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:18.320
It certainly would be possible for you.

00:22:18.930 --> 00:22:21.030
This is all a big misunderstanding!

00:22:21.030 --> 00:22:23.790
Besides, this is the first time I've met this Yabuki!

00:22:23.790 --> 00:22:26.550
The problem was entirely with Tange personally!

00:22:26.550 --> 00:22:31.410
I decided he would be detrimental to the boxing association, and denied him his professional license!

00:22:31.410 --> 00:22:37.490
But you can't close your eyes to the fact that a fighter like him that could fight to a draw...

00:22:37.490 --> 00:22:41.920
with Asia Gym's golden egg, Wolf Kanagushi, is barred from professional boxing, for whatever reason.

00:22:43.590 --> 00:22:45.850
Please, don't report this!

00:22:45.850 --> 00:22:49.430
He just let his guard down because he thought he was an amateur...

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:54.100
Whatever the case, the new rookie champion and an unknown fighter fought to a double KO!

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:55.440
We can't abandon news as valuable as this!

00:22:56.300 --> 00:22:57.440
It's almost the deadline!

00:22:57.440 --> 00:22:58.440
We'd better hurry or we'll miss it!

00:22:58.440 --> 00:23:01.940
Hey, wait! No! Please don't report on this!

00:23:07.060 --> 00:23:11.450
With such a major incident as this, Coach Otaka will have to approve of Tange Gym.

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:19.490
You finally did it, Joe.

00:23:19.490 --> 00:23:22.420
Just like you did in Juvenile Hall.

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:41.510
Joe slammed against the wall of the boxing association in his own way.

00:23:41.510 --> 00:23:44.560
He bet his entire tomorrow on that blow.

00:23:45.540 --> 00:23:50.570
With the tenacity of a stray dog, he has stood back up from the depths of despair!

00:23:51.330 --> 00:23:56.270
Now, the one standing in Joe's way is the high school boxing champion.

00:23:56.270 --> 00:24:01.240
Now, for Joe, who faces a well-trained elite boxer,

00:24:01.240 --> 00:24:03.000
which way is tomorrow!?
